o back to Geminia, I have to give it up.",0,""],["w",0.5],["cbg",1,null,null,1.4,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["se","se_125"],["say","Omnisky Aegis CEO","Well, you have the point there.==W== You were never meant to keep that authority anyway. The PR fire is put out, so you have to hand it back.",0,""],["w",0.7],["goon"],["w",0.5],["say","Omnisky Aegis CEO","Play keep-away with it, and even I won't be able to cover for you.",0,""],["w",0.5],["cbg",1,null,null,0.7,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_220","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Mercurio","The PR fire. Right...==W== Let's talk money.==W== Do we have the 40 billion Dorra ready?",0,""],["w",1],["ctl","avg3_220","a",null,"happy",null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["goon"],["ctl","avg3_220","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["cbg",1,null,null,1.4,"Linear",1.0,null,null,null],["se","se_029"],["say","Omnisky Aegis CEO","Of course. I transferred liquid assets from several branches.==W== We take a narrow loss in the wishing test, then wire the funds back in a few days. That's the plan.",0,""],["w",0.7],["goon"],["w",0.5],["cbg",1,null,null,0.7,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_220","a","003","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Mercurio","...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_220","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["cbg",1,null,null,1.4,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["se","se_048"],["cbg",1,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0,null,null,"chijing"],["say","Omnisky Aegis CEO","Mercurio. Why are you quiet? Don't tell me you actually want the Philae Monolith.==W== 40 billion is just the rent! It's a complete money pit.",0,""],["w",0.7],["goon"],["w",0.5],["cbg",1,null,null,0.7,"OutCubic",1.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_220","a","002","music",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","Mercurio","It's the only way we keep our power.",0,""],["w",0.5],["cbg",1,null,null,1.4,"InCubi